Home




 Jobs




 Data Engineering




 Junior Data Scientist




 Published on Jul 06, 2021




 Meritos Trade




 A Product company with office in Kyiv, Ukraine.




 Apply for a Job




**Experience**
 1\-3 years




**Job Type**
 Full\-Time




 Remote




**Specializations**
 Data Engineering




 Data Science \& AI




**What You Will Do Responsibilities**
* To drive and implement the automation and optimization of volatility trading, including client trade pricing and hedging;
* Improvement and support of existing algorithms;
* Contribute from idea generation to production implementation, perform research, design prototype, implement analytics and trading algorithms;
* Analyze large sets of market data to test hypotheses and obtain useful information;
* Create, develop, test and maintain trading strategies, improve existing ones, incl. using Machine learning algorithms;
* Back test preparation;
* Approval of a successful idea with the team, transfer to the developer for implementation.


 What You Should Bring




 Must\-have




* Experience in Financial, Big Data from 1 years;
* Experience in Data Science — from 1 year;
* Python programming experience required (Data analysis libraries — NumPy, Pandas);
* Higher education — mathematics, statistics, programming, economics;
* Autonomy, orientation and responsibility for the result, system, organization, attentiveness, initiative and openness;
* Have the ability to devise and implement trading algorithms;
* Extensive knowledge on e\-trading infrastructure and data specs, being able to deliver end to end solutions to the business.


 Nice\-to\-have




* Knowledge Machine learning in financial;
* Familiarity with any API: Binance API, BitMex API, Interactive Brokers API, Alpha Vantage API;
* SQL / NoSQL Databases;
* Experience in trading;
* Level of English — Intermediate and above.


**What You Will Get Benefits**
* A strong team in one office, ready to help: financial analysts, traders, developers;
* Medical insurance after the trial period (100% coverage, premium package);
* Career opportunities in Team lead, Head of department;
* We value the free time of our colleagues, therefore we are very flexible in terms of the schedule. We are not tied to the time of work, but to the result;
* Office with comfortable working conditions, 15 minutes walk from the Polytechnic Institute metro station;
* Corporate events;
* 18 working days of paid leave and 12 days of sick leave per year;
* No dress code policy and low level of bureaucracy;
* An individual annual training budget with an opportunity to visit paid conferences, training sessions, workshops, etc.;
* Free corporate library.


